  "body": "There is something particularly appealing about waking up to a view that changes with the seasons. From this north-east corner apartment, the outlook stretches across the lake to the native canopy of Alice Eaves Scenic Reserve, bringing greenery, birdsong and a wonderful sense of openness into everyday life.\r\n\r\nThis is one of Kensington Park's generous two-bedroom designs, with a feeling of space that becomes immediately apparent as you move through the home. Natural light fills the interiors, while the large covered balcony provides a private place to pause and enjoy the setting - coffee in the morning, drinks with friends in the evening, or simply a quiet moment watching life unfold across the Park.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen sits comfortably at the centre of the home, connecting the dining and living areas. Both bedrooms are well proportioned, with the separation between them offering genuine privacy and flexibility. The second bedroom is equally suited to visiting family, guests or a home office, while two secure basement car parks make everyday living particularly easy.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this apartment special, though, extends well beyond its walls. Alice Eaves Scenic Reserve is virtually on your doorstep, with native bush tracks to explore whenever the mood takes you. Orewa Beach, cafés, restaurants and village amenities are also within easy reach, while Kensington Park itself offers beautifully landscaped surroundings and resident facilities including the gymnasium, heated swimming pool and sauna.\r\nIt is a home that gives you more freedom to enjoy your time. There is no lawn to mow or garden to maintain, and when travel calls, you can simply lock the door and go. Come home to a beautifully cared-for environment, a peaceful outlook and a lifestyle that makes it easy to spend more time doing the things you enjoy.\r\n\r\nFor those looking for space, privacy and a home that feels connected to nature without giving up convenience, this is your opportunity.\r\nCome along to an open home or visit us in the onsite sales suite Tues-Sun 10am-2pm.\r\n\r\nKensington Park Realty, Licensed REAA 2008.",
